### Best Practices

- **Lifecycle Mapping**: Align precisely with Agent events: `session_start` to `idle`, `UserPromptSubmit` to `thinking`, `tool_call` to `running` or `working`, `Stop` to `success`, `PermissionRequest` to `alert`, and idle timeouts to `sleeping` or `sleepy`.
- **Interaction & Devil Mutation**: Pass `interactive` to enable tactile click feedback and a rapid-click dizziness easter egg; autonomous exploration or clicking has a chance to mutate into the "Shiny Devil" form (horns, bat wings, arrow tail, golden glints), which can also be forced via the `demon` prop.
- **Pure Vector Performance**: No external sprite sheets or canvas animation loops required. All elements are clean SVG `<rect>` blocks accelerated by CSS `@keyframes` with sub-kilobyte footprint.
- **Proportions**: Use standard `'xs' | 'sm' | 'md' | 'lg'` sizes or numerical values. The 36:20 aspect ratio with flat horizontal base docks neatly in status bars, CoreBox corners, or conversation headers.
- **Monochrome & Accessibility**: Defaults to Tuff signature electric violet (`#810DC6`), shifts to deep obsidian crimson (`#4C0519`) in devil form, and is customizable via the `color` prop. Includes built-in `role="img"` and accessible ARIA announcements.

## API Reference

### Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `state` | `MikoState` | `'idle'` | Current action state, supporting 38 states in total. |
| `size` | `MikoSize` | `'md'` | Size preset (`'xs'` 22px, `'sm'` 30px, `'md'` 50px, `'lg'` 66px) or custom dimension. |
| `color` | `string` | `'#810DC6'` | Main body color. |
| `labels` | `Partial<MikoLabels>` | `{}` | Localized accessibility label overrides. |
| `ariaLabel` | `string` | Generated | Overrides the default accessible announcement. |
| `interactive` | `boolean` | `false` | Enables click feedback, hover glow, and click reactions. |
| `random` | `boolean` | `false` | Enables autonomous random cycling through casual idle behaviors. |
| `randomInterval` | `number` | `5000` | Interval in milliseconds between random state changes. |
| `demon` | `boolean` | `false` | Forces the "Shiny Devil" mutated form. |
| `mutationChance` | `number` | `0.06` | Probability (0 ~ 1) of mutating into the Shiny Devil form during interaction or random state cycles. |

### Events

| Name | Type | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| `click` | `[event: MouseEvent]` | Triggered when clicking on the companion. |
| `stateChange` | `[state: MikoState]` | Triggered when the active state changes (via random timer or reaction). |
| `update:state` | `[state: MikoState]` | Enables `v-model:state` two-way state binding. |
| `mutate` | `[isDemon: boolean]` | Triggered when mutating into or reverting from the Shiny Devil form. |

## Overview

- Renders an ultra-sharp pixel SVG with `role="img"` and `shape-rendering="crispEdges"`.
- 38 supported states: `idle`, `working`, `running`, `demon`, `coffee`, `guitar`, `sleepy`, `ninja`, `fishing`, `magic`, `umbrella`, `heart`, `workout`, `dj`, `chef`, `space`, `thinking`, `success`, `alert`, `error`, `sleeping`, `juggling`, `sweeping`, `reading`, `dizzy`, `peeking`, `stretching`, `bathing`, `curious`, `scratching`, `purring`, `eating`, `dancing`, `cheering`, `gaming`, `hacking`, `celebrating`, and `box`.
- Driven entirely by native CSS `@keyframes` without external GIF or PNG assets.

